npc.greeter.opening=Welcome to Eternia, I'm Prowl, and this is the town of Eternis. Eternia is a realm with something for everybody. To learn more about everything Eternia has to offer, have a look around and talk to the townspeople. Come back and see me when you're done to join one of our worlds.
npc.greeter.waiting=Have a look around Eternis and talk to the townspeople, {player}. Come back and see me when you're done to join one of our worlds.
npc.greeter.returning1=Welcome back {player}, I trust the townspeople gave you a lot to get excited about. Now, it's time for you to go out into the worlds of Eternia. You have some great options ahead of you. The vanilla worlds, which are simply the world of Hytale, with some slight modifications to make adventuring with others work a little bit better. Then you have the Aetherhaven worlds, where you are the leader of your own town, growing it and turning it into whatever you dream of, whether it be a humble little cozy place or a pure economic powerhouse.
npc.greeter.returning2=Some of the menus available to you can be opened by pressing O on your keyboard, while others you'll need to visit one of the townspeople for, or add to your player house with some of our premium shop items! Anyway, the choice is yours, and don't be a stranger. You'll find everything you need to enjoy the realm of Eternia right here in the Hub! Have fun {player}!
npc.greeter.recurring=Nice to see you again {player}, I hope your adventures have treated you well!
npc.housing.opening=Oh, I haven't seen you here before, you must be new. I'm Bramble Hearthleaf, it's nice to meet you. All new Eternians get a brand new plot of land and a choice of several houses for free, and you'll want to go set that up right away. Here is a list of our housing features. Come back to see me any time you want to see your home details.
npc.housing.recurring=Welcome back {player}, what can I do for you today?
npc.guild.opening=What do you want? I'm Torren, and I manage guilds here in Eternia. If you want to start a new guild, you'll need at least 5 members to qualify. Once your guild is formed, I can get you started with claiming a guild plot, and getting your guild house set up and furnished.
npc.guild.recurring=You again? What do you need now?
npc.minigame.opening=Welcome, welcome! Eternia has some big plans for minigames coming in the future, but nothing specific quite yet! Be sure to keep an eye out in the Discord for news!
npc.minigame.recurring=Hi {player}, nothing new to share about minigames at this time. We will let you know as soon as things are in the works.
npc.store.opening=Well hello there dear, and welcome to the royal shop. Whether you're trying to look fabulous, have a stylish home, own a pet, or otherwise personalize your experience here in the Eternia realm, you can find it all here!
npc.store.recurring=Oh well hello again {player}, we've got some wonderful items here just for you!
npc.gatehouse.opening=Hey you, yeah you... you look like the type of person that can get stuff done. Listen, I have this thing here, it's called a season pass. You do a bunch of things for me by just playing in the worlds doing what you like to do, maybe do some of the tasks we have listed, and the Masked Order will reward you greatly. There is a premium track of rewards, but listen, you can not spend a single crown and still get some free stuff. The best part, the rewards never expire! You can always go back and do previous season passes! You in?
npc.gatehouse.recurring=Oh hey {player}, you're back, that's great! Did you get all your rewards yet? Better get out there, the tasks aren't going to complete themselves!
npc.shop.opening=Hey {player}, over here! How did I know your name already? You're the talk of the town! I'm Eternia's market broker, and I run the player shops. If you want to buy something with the gold coins you get from quests, or sell something to other players for gold coins, come see me. I manage all the listings, then I send buyers to the seller's house to complete their purchase! There are a few rules around here though. Items are bound to their world type, which shows in the listings. For example, you cannot buy items from a tenured world to bring into a new world... we wouldn't want to ruin the new world experience, you know!
npc.shop.recurring={player}, back for me I see! What can I help you out with today?
npc.news.opening=Hey hey! I know where to get all the gossip going on around Eternia! For starters, we have a great Discord channel where you can get notified of the latest server news, patches and future updates, as well as give feedback or suggestions and report bugs you find. There is also a great website you can visit that has a lot of information about the server, leaderboards, gifting options and so much more! Check back with me every so often, you never know when I may have some new valuable information!
npc.news.recurring=Good to see you again {player}, no new news today, but check back. You never know when my sources will tell me something good!
