npc.rules.opening=Hello {player}, good to see you today. How do I already know your name? It's my job to know everyone around here. I'm the Master of Arms of Eternia, and I am the enforcer of the rules of the realm. When everyone follows the rules, everyone has fun, and when you break them, you will be punished, up to and including being banned from the realm without refund of any money spent.
npc.rules.opening2=Please read the list of rules below. By continuing to play on Eternia, you agree to all of the rules of the realm. Thank you, and enjoy your time playing.
npc.rules.recurring=Welcome back {player}. There have been no changes to our laws. If there are, I will be sure to alert you of them.
